  "title": "Ford Mustang (1965-1973)",
  "script": "Looking for iconic style and classic power? Check out the Ford Mustang from 1965 to 1973. This legendary muscle car was the start of something huge. The Mustang's early models feature the potent 289 cubic inch V8 engine. With up to 271 horsepower, it made a big splash in the 60s. Power goes straight to the rear wheels, making for a thrilling drive. Compared to rivals like the Chevy Camaro, the Mustang offered more refined styling and a broader engine range.\n\nThis generation is also a favorite for tuning. From performance exhausts to custom carburetors, you can make it truly your own. But it's not just about speed and style. These Mustangs are famous for their lasting value, often appreciating over time. Want a piece of the muscle car history that changes the game? Are you ready to park a symbol of freedom in your driveway? The decision is yours. Let us know if you choose the Mustang legend!",
